        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitubul Senakerib Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ipukat erwosit Esekia Yudaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Eliakim, Sebina ka Yoa tolimokis ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya temasi, “Ikilipit isua iyoŋ, kirwor a ŋaramaik neni kosi a ŋiketiyak kon, anerae ikiyeni isua aŋajep ŋin, nyirwor neni kosi a ŋajep a ŋituŋa a Yudaya epupete ŋituŋa ŋulu edokito arwatata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai tema ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya neni kec, “Itamete iyes ekeyakuunit ayoŋ ekapolon kaŋ alimokin ŋakiro nu neni a erwosit kus ka neni kus nai meere neni a ŋituŋa a ŋulu iboiyete alokidiama arwatata, a ŋulu ebukoritae kaapei ka iyes akinyam ŋacin kec ka akimat ŋakul kec a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya towo kirworik a etoil a ŋolo apolon aŋajep a ŋituŋa a Yudaya, “Kiirasi ŋakiro a erwosit a ŋolo apolon, a erwosit ka Asiriya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimu erwosit ebe, “Nyimyekis Esekia ikimodikini iyes, anerae nyepedori iŋes alakun iyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyimyekis Esekia ikisikinyomi iyes Ekapolon ebala, ‘Kire jik ikilakuni Ekapolon iwon, nyipotokinio etaun lo napedor a erwosit ka Asiriya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyipupokis ŋakiro a Esekia, anerae ebala erwosit ka Asiriya, ‘Tocamutu ekisil ka ayoŋ, ido potu neni kaŋ, epedori nai ŋinituŋanan kus akinyam ŋaraito a epiini keŋ ka ŋaboboryo a ebobore keŋ ka akimat ŋakipi a akare keŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akitodol ŋina abunio ayoŋ arikor iyes nakwap ŋina ikwaan ka akwap kus, akwap ŋina eya ŋikinyom ka epiini, akwap ŋina a ŋamugati ka ŋikito a epiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyicamut Esekia ikimodiyari iyes aŋuna irworor atemar, ikiuni Ekapolon iwon. Apotu mono ŋakujo a ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin toiut ŋituŋa kec anapedor a erwosit ka Asiriya a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai tokona eya ŋakujo ka Amas ka Aripad? Ai eya ŋakujo a Separipaim? Aiut mono ikes Samaria anapedor kaŋ a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuj ani alotooma ŋakujo daadaŋ ŋuna a ŋakwapin abu toiu ŋituŋa a akwap keŋ anapedor kaŋ, epedorya Ekapolon aiun ŋituŋa a Yerusalem anapedor kaŋ?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu Eliakim, Sebina ka Yoa kililiŋa, nyeboŋokis iŋes akirot adio, anerae ecikit erwosit ikes ebe, “Nyiboŋokis ŋakiro keŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Eliakim lokoku ka Ilikia ŋolo apolokinit ŋiticisyo alokai ka apukan ka Sebina ekegirigiran ta Yoa lokoku ka Asap ŋolo apolokinit ŋakiro ŋuna igiritae toloto neni ka Esekia ecilicilito ŋilowi kec, tolimokis iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna erworo ekapolokiniton a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
